me:concept_Urban_Life
    owl:sameAs lcsh:sh85026255 ;
    skos:scopeNote """Refers specifically to the metropolitan lifestyle of Taipei's middle class as portrayed in Edward Yang's films, characterized by a striking contrast between material abundance and spiritual emptiness.""" .

